  "description": "API Test Spark is a Make Bold Spark developer workbench from Make Bold Solutions.\n      Embed its branded React SPA into any .NET 10 Minimal API project with a single MapApiTestSpark()\n      call. It autodiscovers OpenAPI v3 endpoints and renders an interactive test harness at\n      /api-test-spark/. Features include collapsible accordion endpoint groups, Remote API Explorer\n      for multiple named REST APIs, credential-safe server-side profile proxies, browser-manageable\n      remote profiles, full response code documentation with expandable schemas, operationId display,\n      schema constraint and default-value surfacing, markdown rendering of OpenAPI descriptions,\n      sortable response tables, editable object forms, curl command generation, API Doc Builder,\n      draggable debug panel, and Azure Application Insights integration. Zero configuration required —\n      just add MapApiTestSpark().",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
