  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 — Make Bold Solutions brand alignment. API Test Spark now presents\n      as a Make Bold Spark product across the embedded React UI, favicon set, package icon, NuGet metadata,\n      package README, and public documentation. The package includes local Make Bold Solutions brand assets\n      and Inter Tight typography, with no public API changes. See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
